SUMMARY:Park Winters Presents: Holiday Farm Dinner Concert
DESCRIPTION:Marty O’Reilly blends gritty Americana\, soulful blues and raw storytelling into music that feels both timeless and deeply personal. From soft and haunting to wild and electric\, his captivating performances explore love\, loss and connection\, leaving audiences feeling moved long after the final note. Your experience will include cocktail hour starting at 4:30\, followed by a multi-course Farm Dinner at 6 – Music starts at 7:30.\n*tickets are non-refundable
